This is what was added in the last update:

- two new missions (you can get them from the pigeon);
 - beware of the cops! a new event has been added with them;
 - another new house with interiors appeared;
 - fixed a bug with a flood in the boss's house;
 - now the cops leave the boss's house (before they always stood there).

We remind you that we are actively preparing for the launch of multiplayer.
Also in honor of Wanted Raccoon's birthday we made a 50% discount on the game!

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/37928168/cdf36f25e869da852ed3fd044b902c695e1b4cd7.png[/img]

Hi! 

Here it is - bugfix + update:

- Added 3 repeatable quests to the junkyard: collecting building materials from the beaver, obtaining food from the squirrel and obtaining parts from the hedgehog;

 - Fixed some bugs in the plot, such as a double hedgehog car, one did not turning off;

 - Fixed a bug with boxes falling through the ground;

 - New houses with interiors near the boss's house were added.

